Package: mcp-inspector
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, libnotify4, libsecret-1-0, libuuid1, libxss1, libxtst6, xdg-utils
Description: MCP Inspector desktop app and command-line client
 Connect to Model Context Protocol servers, inspect their resources and
 prompts, and call tools through a desktop interface or command-line client.
 Includes the Electron runtime; Node.js and Bun are not required at runtime.
